  (hF:∀ (j:Axis)(σ τ:PermWallJ P), ∃ A:ℕ→P.Slabs j,(∀ᶠ i in atTop,CallBoxJ 0 σ τ j (V i).F (A i) i)∧ Tendsto (fun i=> A i-F i j σ τ) atTop (𝓝 0))
